$2a = 3/4 + 3/5 = 15/20 + 12/20 = 27/20$
$a = 27/40$

We need to verify $a > b$.
$b = 3/4 - 27/40 = 30/40 - 27/40 = 3/40$.
$a = 27/40 > 3/40 = b$, which holds.
The value of $a$ is $27/40$.

